    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "Find the largest power of 10 that is a factor of $10!$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$10^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}10&=2\\times5,\\\\10!&=2^8\\times3^4\\times5^2\\times7.\\end{align*}$$\nThere are enough factors of 2 and 5 to form two pairs of $2\\times5$. Therefore the largest power of 10 that divides $10!$ is $10^2$.",
